9	comment_notifications=on&csrfmiddlewaretoken=Wb1MN6Nl6Am4I87VgalLgoVRLY1cecS3OPzUtjiQT9eXszMkqAJ7kz4lg7P0xsuy&next=&loaded_revision_id=617&loaded_revision_created_at=2026-06-24T18%3A07%3A51.984408%2B00%3A00&title=Sourdough+Bagels&blog_date=2026-01-17&blog_image=19&blog_teaser=For+those+of+you+not+lucky+enough+to+live+near+a+bagel+shop%2C+this+recipe+should+satisfy+your+circular+doughy+cravings.&content-count=1&content-0-deleted=&content-0-order=0&content-0-type=paragraph&content-0-id=2ebae49a-9a92-48ef-95aa-f4ab32e0839a&content-0-value=%7B%22blocks%22%3A%5B%7B%22key%22%3A%22bcy16%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22Why+Bagels%3F%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22header-three%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%2236kbd%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22Ten+years+ago+I+moved+to+the+west+coast+of+Canada.+While+I+was+thoroughly+enjoying+my+new+life+with+larger+mountains+and+more+temperate+weather%2C+I+couldn%27t+quite+shake+that+feeling+like+something+essential+was+missing.+That+something+was+delicious+bagels%2C+which+I+frankly+find+hard+to+live+without.+Most+places+I+had+lived+either+had+one+decent+bagel+shop%2C+or+access+to+frozen+bagels+that+had+been+shipped+up+from+larger+cities+like+Toronto+%28yes%2C+Toronto+has+many+great+bagel+shops%29.+While+trying+to+satisfy+this+craving%2C+I+had+also+started+experimenting+with+sourdough+bread+making.+Through+my+research+I+had+discovered+that+cold+fermentation+often+contributes+to+a+bagel%27s+unique+favor+and+texture.+I+found+that+using+sourdough+starter+was+another+great+way+to+control+the+acidity+of+the+dough.+If+you+don%27t+have+a+sourdough+on+hand+you+can+substitute+it+with+1%2F2+teaspoon+of+active+dry+yeast.+I+also+kneed+everything+by+hand%2C+although+you+can+use+a+stand+mixer+for+the+final+dough.+Enjoy%21%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22unstyled%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%2278gi1%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22Recipe%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22header-two%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%22c78ja%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22Poolish%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22header-three%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%224moo3%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22150+grams+of+whole+wheat+flour%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22unordered-list-item%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%22cm87u%22%2C%22text%22%3A%2250+grams+of+bread+flour%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22unordered-list-item%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%222n5h4%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22335+grams+water%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22unordered-list-item%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%22b4doq%22%2C%22text%22%3A%2240+grams+sourdough+starter+%28recently+refreshed%29%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22unordered-list-item%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%22cj5pj%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22Final+Dough%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22header-three%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%224biv0%22%2C%22text%22%3A%229+grams+of+salt%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22unordered-list-item%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%22e94p5%22%2C%22text%22%3A%2230+grams+diastatic+malt+powder%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22unordered-list-item%22%2C%22depth%22%3A0%2C%22inlineStyleRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22entityRanges%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%2226fha%22%2C%22text%22%3A%2220+grams+suga