g on guitar, and failing math class. </p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5kolt\\\\\\">If you've stumbled onto this site, firstly, I'd like to say welcome, and secondly thank you! I don't know how the heck you got here, but you can bet your lucky starts it had nothing to do with Google SEO (just give me the recipe Google!), or some stink piece on Linked In.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7bf8o\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6dr5l\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3nn5k\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"f5guv\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8n6th\\\\\\"></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"a28f90e6-1305-4bc1-aab9-3215fefce223\\"}]", "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/welcome/youre-blogging-in-2025/", "blog_date": "2025-01-02", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "blog_image": 3, "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "It's 2025, Blog like it's 2025!", "content_type": 44, "live_revision": 10, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 17, "translation_key": "2df69ac9-a9e1-4f59-b3bd-86a5630b411d", "last_published_at": "2025-01-03T01:04:51.369Z", "first_published_at": "2024-12-28T00:47:59.494Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-01-05T00:20:49.864Z"}	\N	6	1	44	1	It's 2025, Blog like it's 2025!
