-4493-80ee-0112d7ae5dfc", "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-12-31T21:41:01.703Z"}	\N	11	1	44	1	Sourdough Bagels
